==Status Report (this round)==
ROOT CAUSE (confirmed from on-device dumpsys): Wcast's audio focus is fine - on play
it takes GAIN focus and Spotify loses it. The failure is media-button *routing*.
dumpsys media_session showed `Media button session is com.spotify.music/...` with a
mediaButtonReceiver set, while Wcast never called MediaSession.setMediaButtonReceiver,
so the system kept routing headset presses to Spotify (dumpsys audio focus log showed
Spotify re-requesting focus ~seconds after each Wcast play = Spotify resuming on the
button press; hence Arama single-press / KOSS double-press flipping to the last player).

FIX: Wcast now registers a media-button receiver exactly like Spotify -
MediaSession.setMediaButtonReceiver(...) wired to a new manifest MediaButtonReceiver
(ACTION_MEDIA_BUTTON, exported=false) that forwards the press to
SpeechControllerBridge.togglePlayPause. Foreground service + active session + focus are
unchanged. Added WcastMedia logcat lines (receiver delivery, session callback delivery,
focus changes) so the next round is unambiguous.

RE-TEST (Arama wired, KOSS wireless, Aftershokz): expected is one press pauses Wcast
(stream retained), next press resumes Wcast, Spotify stays stopped. If any headset still
misbehaves, capture while it misbehaves and paste the output:
